    "description": {
      "value": "<p>With uncanny block, a knight can interpose a shield between himself and danger before his senses would normally allow him to do so. When the knight has a shield equipped, he cannot be caught flat-footed even if the attacker is invisible. He still loses his Dexterity bonus to AC if immobilized or if a foe successfully makes a Bluff check to feint against him.</p>",
